# Task 2: Splice in expression position is an expansion-time error.
# A macro returning splice cannot be used as a plain expression (only in dict/doc context).
[macro two-ints [let ...args]
  [type: "splice"
   forms: [
     [type: "literal"  kind: "int"  value: 10]
     [type: "literal"  kind: "int"  value: 20]
   ]]]

[+ [two-ints] 1]
=== error
[E080] macro 'two-ints' returned invalid AST: dict_to_surface_node: unknown node type: splice (defined at 9:4-9:14)
